{
  "borough": "Harrow",
  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-top: 0cm; margin-right: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; break-after: avoid;&quot;&gt;The &lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;proposed detached dwellinghouse, by reason\r\nof its &lt;/span&gt;proximity\r\nto front and side boundaries; protruding front elevation forward of Omega\r\nCottage and its excessive width, &lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;would\r\nintroduce a cramped and overdeveloped appearance &amp;nbsp;that would interrupt the pattern and grain of\r\ndevelopment within the Wolverton Road street scene, contrary to the high\r\nquality design aspirations of the National Planning Policy Framework (2023), &lt;/span&gt;Policies D3.D (1) and\r\nD3.D (11) of the London Plan (2021), Policy CS1.B of the Harrow Core Strategy\r\n(2012), Policy DM1 of the Harrow Development Management Polices Local Plan\r\n(2013) and the Residential Design Guide Supplementary Planning Document (2010).&lt;font face=&quot;Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 107%;&quot;&gt;The proposal, by reason of an unsatisfactory\r\nFlood Risk Assessment, fails demonstrate that the proposed development would\r\neffectively manage and mitigate flood risk on site or on the adjacent\r\nproperties, and that it would not create an unacceptable level of flood risk.\r\nFurthermore, there is no compensatory flood storage or drainage strategy provided\r\nwithin the submitted Flood Risk Assessment. The proposed development would\r\ntherefore be contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework (2023), policy\r\nSI 12 of The London Plan (2021), Core Policy CS1 U of Harrow Core Strategy\r\n(2012) policies DM 9 and DM10 of the Harrow Development Management Polices\r\nLocal Plan (2013).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-top: 0cm; margin-right: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; break-after: avoid;&quot;&gt;The proposed dwellinghouse, by reason\r\nof its siting and proximity to the existing dwelling No 12 Savernake Court;\r\nwould result in an overbearing impact and unacceptable loss of outlook to this\r\nneighbour, contrary to the&amp;nbsp; National\r\nPlanning Policy Framework (2023), Policies D3.D 7) and D6.B of The London Plan\r\n(2021), Policy DM 1 of the Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013),\r\nand the adopted Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide\r\n(2010).&lt;font face=&quot;Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
